<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-ῡλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>abounding in forests,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>abounding in materials,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.171
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σῶμα</span>”
				<i>plethoric,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.13.2
			</span></i>, cf. Heliod.ib.<i><span class="en">
				46.20.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>consisting of many kinds of matter,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονόϋλος,</span> Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.112B.
			</span></i>; <i>requiring abundance of materials,</i> of a remedy,
				<i><span class="en">
				Afric.
				<u>Cest.</u>
				p.30
			</span></i> V. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Rhet.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π. τῆς ῥητορικῆς</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				Rh.
				4.63
			</span></i> W.</div>
